<title>MEXICO: Mexico's ICA says to have share split.</title>
<headline>Mexico's ICA says to have share split.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empresas ICA said on Friday that it had approved a share split, giving six shares for each one, from July 15.</p>
<p>ICA is Mexico's largest construction company.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom, 525 728-9562))</p>
